{"id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-purehorn.md","title":"Pure Horn function (DNF convention)","display":"df-purehorn — Pure Horn function (DNF convention)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-purehorn","aliases":["27-df-purehorn"],"display":"df-purehorn — Pure Horn function (DNF convention)","depends_on":["[[27-df-purehorndnf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-purehorn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-purehorn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-purehorn — Pure Horn function (DNF convention)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c66adeeb535366b\" href=\"?note=8c66adeeb535366b\" title=\"27-df-purehorndnf\">27-df-purehorndnf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c66adeeb535366b\" href=\"?note=8c66adeeb535366b\" title=\"27-df-purehorndnf\">27-df-purehorndnf</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.4 and Theorem 6.3，印刷页 271–272，PDF 第 295–296 页（从 1 计数）。 按原书采用 pure Horn DNF；其 all-one 点必为假。旧版本的 pure Horn CNF 语义是这里函数的补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purehorndnf","status":"resolved","id":"8c66adeeb535366b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorndnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorndnf","status":"resolved","id":"8c66adeeb535366b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-purehorndnf]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $S\\subseteq[n]$ and $F(f)$ are as in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-truefalse]]."},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorn|df-purehorn — Pure Horn function (DNF convention)]]"},{"id":"271798b3fdcbdca0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-hornclosure]]."},{"id":"cd4ceead6b210901","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-purehorn]], [[27-df-hornterm]] and [[27-df-piset]]."},{"id":"cd6815db60d4efdb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(